<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> › Cookie policy</div>
    <span class="eyebrow hero__eyebrow">Cookies</span>
    <h1>Cookie policy</h1>
    <p>How and why <%= SITE.name %> uses cookies and similar technologies on this website.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose" style="max-width:800px;">
      <p class="muted">Last updated: <%= updated %>.</p>

      <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small files a website stores on your device. Websites can also store information in your browser in similar ways (called local storage).</p>

      <h2>What this website stores</h2>
      <table class="table" style="margin-top:1rem;">
        <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>What it does</th><th>How long</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>vc_admin</code></td><td>Strictly necessary cookie</td><td>Keeps our staff signed in to the staff hub. It’s only set when a member of staff signs in — visitors never get it.</td><td>12 hours</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>venza-…</code></td><td>Local storage (on your device only)</td><td>Remembers which items you’ve ticked on the “What to bring” checklist on our FAQs page. It never leaves your device.</td><td>Until you clear it</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>We don’t use advertising, analytics or tracking cookies, so we don’t need to ask for your consent. We count visits to the website without cookies — see our <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>.</p>

      <h2>Content from other websites</h2>
      <p>Some pages load content from other services, which receive your IP address when they do. They may set their own cookies under their own policies:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — the typefaces used on every page;</li>
        <li><strong>OpenStreetMap</strong> — the map on our Find a home page;</li>
        <li><strong>Care Quality Commission</strong> — the official CQC rating box on a home’s page.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>“Get directions” and map links open Google Maps only when you click them.</p>

      <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
      <p>You can see and delete cookies and stored data in your browser’s settings at any time. Blocking them won’t affect the public website; staff won’t be able to stay signed in to the staff hub.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:2rem;"><a href="/privacy" class="care-card__link">See our privacy policy →</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
